mediate purchases on sale pages. Note: the original page at https://www.yogadirect.com/sale was not accessible from this environment, so the page was rebuilt using conversion best practices for the YogaDirect sale context.\", \"Hash\": \"89844227\"}, {\"What\": \"Created a bold hero section with a clear value proposition ('Save Up to 60% Off') and a single high-contrast primary CTA that anchors to the deals grid.\", \"Why\": \"A clear headline plus one dominant call-to-action reduces decision friction and increases scroll-through and click-through to products.\", \"Hash\": \"35bb514b\"}, {\"What\": \"Redesigned the product grid with strike-through original prices, explicit dollar/percent savings badges, star ratings with review counts, and one-click Add to Cart buttons.\", \"Why\": \"Price anchoring, visible savings, and social proof at the point of decision significantly increase add-to-cart rates; reducing clicks to purchase increases revenue per session.\", \"Hash\": \"a5c3ee25\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a USP trust strip (free shipping over $50, 30-day returns, secure checkout, 4.8/5 rating) directly under the hero and repeated trust/payment badges in the footer.\", \"Why\": \"Addressing shipping cost, return risk, and payment security objections early builds the confidence needed to convert, especially for first-time visitors.\", \"Hash\": \"96ecbdd7\"}, {\"What\": \"Added scarcity indicators on product cards ('Only 7 left in stock') alongside availability reassurance ('In stock — ships today').\", \"Why\": \"Genuine scarcity messaging leverages loss aversion to accelerate purchase decisions, while shipping-speed reassurance removes hesitation.\", \"Hash\": \"4d78a885\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a verified-buyer testimonial section with named customers and aggregate rating (12,000+ yogis, 4.8/5).\", \"Why\": \"Third-party social proof near the bottom of the funnel lifts conversion by validating quality claims for discounted products, which shoppers often worry are lower