 Bolsters</h3><p>Slim and lightweight for breathing practice and gentle spinal support. Also ideal for travel and precise propping in Iyengar-style practice.</p></div></div></section><section class='faq'><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><details open><summary>Which yoga bolster shape should I choose?</summary><p>Round bolsters offer a deeper stretch for backbends and heart openers. Rectangular bolsters provide a flatter, more stable base ideal for restorative poses and prenatal yoga. Pranayama bolsters are slimmer and designed for breathing exercises and spinal support.</p></details><details><summary>Are the covers removable and washable?</summary><p>Yes — every bolster includes a durable cotton cover with a sturdy zipper that removes easily for machine washing.</p></details><details><summary>Do bolsters ship free?</summary><p>All orders over $75 ship free within the contiguous US. Most orders ship within 1 business day from our Richmond, VA warehouse.</p></details><details><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><p>We offer hassle-free 30-day returns. If you're not completely satisfied, return your bolster for a full refund — no restocking fees.</p></details></section><section class='email'><h2>Get 10% Off Your First Order</h2><p>Join our newsletter for exclusive deals, restorative yoga tips, and new product launches.</p><form action='/newsletter' method='post'><input type='email' name='email' placeholder='Enter your email' required aria-label='Email address'><button type='submit'>Get My 10% Off</button></form></section></main><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='cols'><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/yoga-mats'>Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href='/bolsters'>Bolsters</a></li><li><a href='/yoga-blocks'>Blocks</a></li><li><a href='/meditation-cushions'>Meditation Cushions</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/shipping'>Shipping Info</a></li><li><a href='/returns'>Returns &amp; Refunds</a></li><li><a href='/contact'>Contact Us</a></li><li><a hr