s for category-page conversion.\", \"Hash\": \"d1f08b3a\"}, {\"What\": \"Added merchandising badges (Best Seller, Sale, Bundle & Save) and a bolster + blanket bundle SKU priced to qualify for free shipping.\", \"Why\": \"Badges guide choice for undecided shoppers and bundles directly raise average order value and revenue per session.\", \"Hash\": \"62aa4f9d\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a 'Which Bolster Is Right for You?' buying guide comparing round, rectangular, and pranayama bolsters.\", \"Why\": \"Choice paralysis is a top drop-off cause on category pages; concise guidance moves shoppers to a confident selection faster.\", \"Hash\": \"e84c1d57\"}, {\"What\": \"Added an FAQ section (with matching FAQPage JSON-LD structured data) covering shape selection, washable covers, shipping, and returns.\", \"Why\": \"Answering objections on-page prevents exits, and FAQ rich results improve SERP click-through, driving more qualified traffic.\", \"Hash\": \"17b9e6c0\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a 10%-off email capture block above the footer.\", \"Why\": \"Capturing non-buyers' emails enables remarketing that recovers otherwise-lost revenue from the ~97% who don't purchase on first visit.\", \"Hash\": \"4fd3a2b6\"}, {\"What\": \"Made the header sticky with persistent search, phone number, and cart; added mobile-responsive layout and payment/security badges in the footer.\", \"Why\": \"Persistent navigation and visible phone support reduce friction, and payment badges plus responsive design lift mobile conversion, typically the majority of traffic.\", \"Hash\": \"a0c67e91\"}, {\"What\": \"Added SEO fundamentals: keyword-rich title tag, meta description, canonical URL, semantic headings, and descriptive intro copy for the category.\", \"Why\": \"Better organic rankings and click-through for 'yoga bolster' queries grow qualified traffic, compounding conversion improvements into revenue.\", \"Hash\": \"5be0d9f4\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'll fetch the URL to examine the HTML structure