n      <div class=\\\"card-body\\\">\\n        <h3><a href=\\\"/restorative-yoga-kit\\\">Restorative Kit: Blanket + Bolster + 2 Blocks + Strap</a></h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"stars-sm\\\" aria-label=\\\"Rated 4.9 out of 5\\\">★★★★★<span>(76 reviews)</span></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\"><span class=\\\"now\\\">$74.95</span><span class=\\\"was\\\">$92.80</span><span class=\\\"save\\\">Save 19%</span></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"stock\\\">✓ In stock — free shipping included</div>\\n        <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" data-product=\\\"restorative-yoga-kit\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </article>\\n\\n  </section>\\n</main>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"why\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <h2>Why Buy Your Yoga Blankets from YogaDirect?</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"why-grid\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"item\\\"><h3>🏷️ Wholesale-Direct Pricing</h3><p>We import directly, so you pay studio prices — no middleman markup. Found it cheaper? We'll match it.</p></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"item\\\"><h3>🧘 Studio-Grade Quality</h3><p>Tightly woven, colorfast and machine washable. The same blankets used in 10,000+ studios nationwide.</p></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"item\\\"><h3>🚚 Fast, Free Shipping</h3><p>Orders over $50 ship free. In-stock items leave our warehouse within 24 hours, Monday–Friday.</p></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"item\\\"><h3>💯 30-Day Guarantee</h3><p>Not delighted? Return it within 30 days for a full refund — no hassle, no restocking fees.</p></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <h2>Yoga Blanket FAQs</h2>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>Which yoga blanket is best for restorative yoga?</summary>\\n      <p>Our Deluxe Mexican Yoga Blanket is the most popular choice for restorative practice. It's extra thick, folds into firm supportive shapes, and holds its structure under weight — ideal for supported bridge, legs-up-the-wall and savasana.</p>\\n    </details>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>How do I wash a Mexican yoga blanket?</summary>\\n      <p>Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle and tumble dry low or line dry. Our blankets are colorfast and pre-shrunk, so they hold their size and vibrant colors wash after wash.</p>\\n    </details>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>What size are your yoga blankets?</summary>\\n      <p>Standard blankets measure approximately 74\\\" x 52\\\" — large enough to fold for props, cover you fully in savasana, or double as a picnic or beach blanket.</p>\\n    </details>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>Do you offer wholesale pricing for studios?</summary>\\n      <p>Yes! Our 10-packs already include bulk savings, and orders of 25+ blankets qualify for additional wholesale discounts. <a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Request a wholesale quote</a> or call 1-800-331-8233.</p>\\n    </details>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"seo-copy\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <h2>About Our Yoga Blankets</h2>\\n    <p>A quality yoga blanket is one of the most versatile props you can own. Folded, it provides height and support under hips in seated poses, cushions knees in low lunges, and props shoulders in shoulderstand. Unfolded, it keeps you warm and grounded during savasana and meditation.</p>\\n    <p>YogaDirect has supplied yoga studios, gyms, schools and home practitioners with premium Mexican, cotton, wool and fleece yoga blankets since 1998. Because we sell direct, you get studio-grade quality at prices well below specialty retailers — with fast shipping and a 30-day money-back guarantee on every order.</p>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"email-cta\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <h2>Get 10% Off Your First Order</h2>\\n    <p>Join 50,000+ yogis and get exclusive deals, restock alerts and practice tips.</p>\\n    <form class=\\\"email-form\\\" action=\\\"/subscribe\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n      <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\" required aria-label=\\\"Email address\\\">\\n      <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Get My 10% Off</button>\\n    </form>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"foot-grid\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Shop</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/blankets\\\">Yoga Blankets</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-blocks\\\">Blocks &amp; Straps</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/bolsters\\\">Bolsters</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Clearance</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Customer Care</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping Information</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns &amp; 30-Day Guarantee</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/faq\\\">FAQ</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>For Studios</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale Program</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/bulk-orders\\\">Bulk Order Quotes</a></li>\\n          <li><a href=\\\"/gift-cards\\\">Gift Cards</a></li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h4>Get in Touch</h4>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li>📞 <a href=\\\"tel:1-800-331-8233\\\">1-800-331-8233</a></li>\\n          <li>✉️ <a href=\\\"mailto:support@yogadirect.com\\\">support@yogadirect.com</a></li>\\n          <li>Mon–Fri, 9am–5pm ET</li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"foot-bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"payments\\\">VISA &nbsp;•&nbsp; MASTERCARD &nbsp;•&nbsp; AMEX &nbsp;•&nbsp; DISCOVER &nbsp;•&nbsp; PAYPAL &nbsp;•&nbsp; 🔒 SSL SECURE CHECKOUT</div>\\n      <p>&copy; 2025 YogaDirect.com — All Rights Reserved. Trusted yoga equipment supplier since 1998.</p>