lass=\\\"card-body\\\">\\n        <h3><a href=\\\"/foam-yoga-block-10-pack\\\">4&quot; Foam Yoga Blocks – Bulk 10-Pack for Studios</a></h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"rev\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span> (74 reviews)</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price\\\"><span class=\\\"now\\\">$54.95</span><span class=\\\"was\\\">$69.50</span><span class=\\\"save\\\">Save 21%</span></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"stock\\\">✓ In stock — free shipping</div>\\n        <button class=\\\"add-btn\\\" type=\\\"button\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </article>\\n  </section>\\n  <section class=\\\"bulk\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h2>Outfitting a Studio, Gym or School?</h2>\\n      <p>Get exclusive volume pricing on blocks and wedges — the more you buy, the more you save. Our wholesale team will beat any competitor's quote on comparable products.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <a class=\\\"btn-outline\\\" href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Get a Wholesale Quote →</a>\\n  </section>\\n  <section class=\\\"guide\\\">\\n    <h2>How to Choose the Right Yoga Block</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"guide-grid\\\">\\n      <div><h3>Foam — Best for Beginners</h3><p>Lightweight, soft on the body, and easy on the budget. Perfect for restorative practice, gentle yoga and travel. Our most popular choice.</p></div>\\n      <div><h3>Cork — Best for Stability</h3><p>Firm, grippy and naturally antimicrobial. The go-to for balance poses, power yoga and heavy studio use. Eco-friendly and durable.</p></div>\\n      <div><h3>Bamboo — Best for Longevity</h3><p>A beautiful, rock-solid prop that lasts a lifetime. Ideal for practitioners who want maximum support and a premium feel.</p></div>\\n      <div><h3>Wedges — Best for Joint Relief</h3><p>Reduce wrist strain in Downward Dog and planks, and support tight hamstrings, ankles and hips in seated poses.</p></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n  <section class=\\\"reviews\\\">\\n    <h2>What Our Customers Say</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"review-grid\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span><p>“I ordered 20 foam blocks for my studio and they arrived in two days. Great quality at half the price I was paying elsewhere.”</p><div class=\\\"who\\\">Sarah M. <span>Verified Buyer — Studio Owner, Austin TX</span></div></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span><p>“The cork block is incredibly sturdy. It made a huge difference in my half-moon pose. Shipping was free and fast.”</p><div class=\\\"who\\\">Daniel R. <span>Verified Buyer — Denver CO</span></div></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span><p>“The wedge saved my wrists! I can finally hold Down Dog without pain. Wish I'd bought it years ago.”</p><div class=\\\"who\\\">Priya K. <span>Verified Buyer — Seattle WA</span></div></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n  <section class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\\n    <details open><summary>Should I choose a foam or cork yoga block?</summary><p>Foam blocks are lightweight, soft and budget-friendly — great for beginners, restorative yoga and travel. Cork blocks are firmer, heavier and more stable, making them ideal for balance poses and heavy studio use.</p></details>\\n    <details><summary>What size yoga block should I buy?</summary><p>The 4-inch block is our most popular all-purpose size and works for most practitioners. Choose a 3-inch block if you have smaller hands or prefer a lower lift for seated poses.</p></details>\\n    <details><summary>What is a yoga wedge used for?</summary><p>A yoga wedge reduces strain on the wrists in weight-bearing poses like Downward Dog and plank, and supports tight hamstrings, ankles and lower backs in seated and standing poses.</p></details>\\n    <details><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><p>Orders placed before 2 PM ET ship the same business day from our US warehouse. Orders over $50 ship free.</p></details>\\n    <details><summary>What if I'm not satisfied?<