 Bikram hot yoga towel\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"400\\\" height=\\\"400\\\"></a><div class=\\\"card-body\\\"><h3><a href=\\\"/bikram-yoga-towel-xl\\\">Bikram Hot Yoga Towel XL – 26\\\" x 80\\\"</a></h3><div><span class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-label=\\\"Rated 4.7 out of 5\\\">★★★★☆</span><span class=\\\"reviews\\\">(529 reviews)</span></div><div class=\\\"price\\\">$26.99</div><div class=\\\"stock\\\">✓ In stock – ships today if ordered by 2pm ET</div><button class=\\\"add-cart\\\" type=\\\"button\\\">Add to Cart</button></div></article><article class=\\\"card\\\"><a href=\\\"/yoga-towel-3-pack\\\" class=\\\"img\\\"><img src=\\\"/images/products/towel-3-pack.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Three-pack of assorted microfiber yoga towels\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"400\\\" height=\\\"400\\\"></a><div class=\\\"card-body\\\"><h3><a href=\\\"/yoga-towel-3-pack\\\">Microfiber Yoga Towel 3-Pack (Studio Value)</a></h3><div><span class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-label=\\\"Rated 4.8 out of 5\\\">★★★★★</span><span class=\\\"reviews\\\">(174 reviews)</span></div><div class=\\\"price\\\"><span class=\\\"was\\\">$59.97</span>$44.99</div><div class=\\\"save\\\">You save $14.98 (25%) – ships FREE</div><div class=\\\"stock\\\">✓ In stock – ships today if ordered by 2pm ET</div><button class=\\\"add-cart\\\" type=\\\"button\\\">Add to Cart</button></div></article></section><section class=\\\"why\\\" aria-label=\\\"Why buy from YogaDirect\\\"><h2>Why Yogis Choose YogaDirect Towels</h2><div class=\\\"why-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"why-item\\\"><div class=\\\"ico\\\">💧</div><h3>Grips Better When Wet</h3><p>Our microfiber weave increases traction as you sweat — no more slipping in downward dog.</p></div><div class=\\\"why-item\\\"><div class=\\\"ico\\\">🧺</div><h3>Machine Washable</h3><p>Toss it in the wash after class. Dries fast, resists odor, and lasts for years.</p></div><div class=\\\"why-item\\\"><div class=\\\"ico\\\">🚚</div><h3>Fast, Free Shipping</h3><p>Orders over $75 ship free. Most orders leave our warehouse the same day.</p></div><div class=\\\"why-item\\\"><div class=\\\"ico\\\">✅</div><h3>30-Day Guarantee</h3><p>Not sweating the details? If you don't love it, return it within 30 days for a full refund.</p></div></div></section><section class=\\\"faq\\\" aria-label=\\\"Frequently asked questions\\\"><h2>Yoga Towel FAQs</h2><details><summary>What size yoga towel do I need?</summary><p>A full-size mat towel (24\\\" x 72\\\") covers a standard yoga mat completely and is ideal for hot yoga. If you have an extra-long mat, choose our XL 26\\\" x 80\\\" towel. Hand towels (16\\\" x 24\\\") are perfect for wiping sweat between poses.</p></details><details><summary>Do yoga towels really prevent slipping?</summary><p>Yes — microfiber yoga towels are designed to become grippier as they absorb moisture. For maximum traction from the very start of class, lightly mist your towel with water before you begin.</p></details><details><summary>How do I wash my yoga towel?</summary><p>Machine wash cold with like colors and tumble dry low. Avoid fabric softener, which can reduce absorbency. Our towels hold up to hundreds of washes.</p></details><details><summary>What's the difference between a yoga towel and a regular towel?</summary><p>Yoga towels are cut to fit your mat, made of ultra-absorbent split microfiber, and engineered for grip. Regular cotton towels bunch up, slide around and hold far less moisture.</p></details></section><section class=\\\"newsletter\\\"><h2>Get 10% Off Your First Order</h2><p>Join 50,000+ yogis and get exclusive deals, new product alerts and practice tips — plus 10% off today.</p><form action=\\\"/newsletter/subscribe\\\" method=\\\"post\\\"><input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\" required aria-label=\\\"Email address\\\"><button type=\\\"submit\\\">Get My 10% Off</button></form></section></main><footer><div class=\\\"foot-grid\\\"><div><h4>YogaDirect</h4><p>Quality yoga gear at direct-to-you p