\\"</td><td><a href=\\\"/anti-burst-fitness-ball-65cm\\\">65cm Ball (Best Seller)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Over 6'0\\\"</td><td><a href=\\\"/anti-burst-fitness-ball-75cm\\\">75cm Ball</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><h2 style=\\\"font-size:20px\\\">Why Buy From YogaDirect?</h2><ul style=\\\"list-style:none;color:#555;font-size:15px\\\"><li style=\\\"margin-bottom:10px\\\">✅ <strong>Anti-burst safety:</strong> our balls deflate slowly if punctured — no sudden pops.</li><li style=\\\"margin-bottom:10px\\\">✅ <strong>Gym-quality material:</strong> supports up to 600 lbs, latex-free and phthalate-free.</li><li style=\\\"margin-bottom:10px\\\">✅ <strong>Pump included:</strong> inflate and start training the day it arrives.</li><li style=\\\"margin-bottom:10px\\\">✅ <strong>Risk-free:</strong> 30-day money-back guarantee on every order.</li><li>✅ <strong>Trusted since 1999:</strong> supplying studios, gyms, and physical therapists nationwide.</li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\\\"section\\\"><h2>What Our Customers Say</h2><div class=\\\"reviews\\\"><div class=\\\"review\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</div><p>\\\"I use the 65cm ball as my desk chair and my lower back pain is gone after two weeks. Sturdy, easy to inflate, great price.\\\"</p><div class=\\\"who\\\">— Sarah M., Verified Buyer</div></div><div class=\\\"review\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</div><p>\\\"We ordered 20 balls for our physical therapy clinic. Excellent quality, fast shipping, and they've held up to daily use for over a year.\\\"</p><div class=\\\"who\\\">— Dr. James R., PT Clinic Owner</div></div><div class=\\\"review\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</div><p>\\\"The size chart made choosing easy. The pump included was a nice touch — this beats anything I found at big-box stores.\\\"</p><div class=\\\"who\\\">— Angela T., Verified Buyer</div></div></div></section><section class=\\\"section faq\\\"><h2>Fitness Ball FAQs</h2><details open><summary>What size fitness ball should I buy?</summary><p>Choose based on your height: under 5'0\\\" use 45cm, 5'0\\\"–5'5\\\" use 55cm, 5'6\\\"–6'0\\\" use 65cm, and over 6'0\\\" use 75cm. When seated, your hips and knees should form 90° angles.</p></details><details><summary>Are your fitness balls anti-burst?</summary><p>Yes. All YogaDirect fitness balls are made with anti-burst material that deflates slowly if punctured rather than popping, and each supports up to 600 lbs.</p></details><details><summary>Do fitness balls come with a pump?</summary><p>Most of our fitness balls include a free hand pump — check each product description. You can also add our heavy-duty pump for faster inflation.</p></details><details><summary>Can I use a fitness ball as a desk chair?</summary><p>Absolutely — active sitting engages your core and can improve posture. Pair your ball with our stability base to keep it in place at your desk.</p></details><details><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><p>Every order is covered by our 30-day money-back guarantee. If you're not satisfied for any reason, contact us for a full refund.</p></details></section><section class=\\\"newsletter\\\"><h2>Get 10% Off Your First Order</h2><p>Join 50,000+ subscribers for exclusive deals, new arrivals, and free workout guides.</p><form action=\\\"/newsletter/subscribe\\\" method=\\\"post\\\"><input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\" required aria-label=\\\"Email address\\\"><button type=\\\"submit\\\">Get My 10% Off</button></form></section></main><footer><div class=\\\"container\\\"><div class=\\\"footer-grid\\\"><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/fitness-balls\\\">Fitness Balls</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/yoga-props\\\">Yoga Props</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Customer Service</h4><ul><li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping Info</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns &amp; Refunds</a></li><li><a hr