 </div>\\n    </article>\\n\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section class=\\\"guarantee\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"shield\\\">🛡️</div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h2>Try It Risk-Free for 30 Days</h2>\\n      <p>Sit with your new cushion at home. If it isn't the perfect fit for your practice, return it within 30 days for a full refund — no restocking fees, no hassle. Plus, every product is backed by our <a href=\\\"/lowest-price-guarantee\\\">lowest price guarantee</a>.</p>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section class=\\\"reviews\\\" aria-label=\\\"Customer reviews\\\">\\n    <h2>Loved by Meditators Everywhere</h2>\\n    <p class=\\\"agg\\\"><b>★★★★★</b> 4.8 out of 5 &nbsp;·&nbsp; based on 3,200+ verified reviews</p>\\n    <div class=\\\"review-grid\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</div>\\n        <p>\\\"The buckwheat zafu completely changed my morning sits. My hips finally stopped aching and I can sit for 40 minutes comfortably. Shipping was fast, too.\\\"</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"who\\\">Sarah M. · <span class=\\\"verified\\\">✓ Verified Buyer</span></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</div>\\n        <p>\\\"Bought the zafu &amp; zabuton set for our meditation room. Beautiful quality, firm but comfortable, and the set price saved me real money.\\\"</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"who\\\">David R. · <span class=\\\"verified\\\">✓ Verified Buyer</span></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</div>\\n        <p>\\\"I teach a weekly meditation class and have ordered from YogaDirect for years. Consistent quality and their customer service is genuinely helpful.\\\"</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"who\\\">Priya K. · <span class=\\\"verified\\\">✓ Verified Buyer</span></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section class=\\\"seo\\\" id=\\\"guide\\\">\\n    <h2>How to Choose the Right Meditation Cushion</h2>\\n    <p><strong>Zafu cushions</strong> are the classic round meditation seat — ideal for cross-legged postures like Burmese or half-lotus. Choose <strong>buckwheat fill</strong> if you want a firm seat that molds to your body, or <strong>kapok fill</strong> for a softer, springier feel. If your knees or ankles are sensitive, pair your zafu with a <strong>zabuton mat</strong> to cushion your legs from the floor.</p>\\n    <p>Prefer kneeling? A <strong>meditation bench</strong> keeps your spine upright while taking pressure off your ankles — most of ours fold flat for travel. And a <strong>crescent zafu</strong> offers extra thigh support if a round cushion tilts your pelvis uncomfortably. Still unsure? <a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Ask our team</a> — we sit on these cushions every day and love to help.</p>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>What's the difference between buckwheat and kapok fill?</summary>\\n      <div class=\\\"a\\\">Buckwheat hulls are heavier and mold to your shape, giving a firm, grounded seat that holds its position. Kapok is a plant fiber that's lighter and springier — softer underneath you, but it doesn't conform as closely. Most experienced sitters prefer buckwheat; beginners often like kapok's softness.</div>\\n    </details>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>How long will it take to receive my order?</summary>\\n      <div class=\\\"a\\\">In-stock items ship within 24 hours Monday–Friday. Standard delivery takes 3–6 business days within the continental US, and orders over $75 ship free.</div>\\n    </details>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>Can I return a cushion if it doesn't work for me?</summary>\\n      <div class=\\\"a\\\">Yes — every product comes with a 30-day money-back guarantee. If it's not right for your practice, return it for a full refund with no restocking fees.</div>\\n    </details>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>Are your cushion covers washable?</summary>\\n      <div class=\\\"a\\\">Yes. All of our zafus and zabutons feature removable cotton covers that are machine washable on cold. The inner fill stays in a separate liner.</div>\\n    </details>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section class=\\\"email\\\">\\n    <h2>Get 10% Off Your First Order</h2>\\n    <p>Join 50,000+ subscribers for exclusive deals, new arrivals and free meditation guides.</p>\\n    <form action=\\\"/newsletter/subscribe\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n      <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\" required aria-label=\\\"Email address\\\">\\n      <button type=\\\"submit\\\">Get 10% Off</button>\\n    </form>\\n    <small>No spam, ever. Unsubscribe anytime.</small>\\n  </section>\\n\\n</main>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"sticky-cta\\\"><a href=\\\"#products\\\">Shop Meditation Bestsellers — Free Shipping $75+</a></div>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"footer-grid\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Shop</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/meditation\\\">Meditation Supplies</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/yoga-props\\\">Yoga Props</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>Customer Care</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping Info</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/returns\\\">Returns &amp; Refunds</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/faq\\\">FAQ</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>About</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/about\\\">Our Story</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/lowest-price-guarantee\\\">Price Guarantee</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/blog\\\">Blog</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div>\\n      <h4>We Accept</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li>Visa · Mastercard · Amex