class='section-title'>Hot Yoga Best Sellers</h2><p class='section-sub'>Hand-picked gear engineered for heated classes — most orders ship same day.</p><div class='grid'><div class='card'><span class='badge'>Best Seller</span><div class='thumb'>🧘</div><div class='card-body'><h3>Skidless Hot Yoga Mat Towel — Microfiber, Full Length</h3><div class='stars'>★★★★★ <span class='count'>(1,284 reviews)</span></div><div class='price'><s>$44.95</s>$34.95</div><div class='stock'>🔥 Selling fast — 9 left in stock</div><button class='add-btn'>Add to Cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><span class='badge blue'>Top Rated</span><div class='thumb'>🌿</div><div class='card-body'><h3>PU Rubber Hot Yoga Mat — Moisture-Activated Grip, 5mm</h3><div class='stars'>★★★★★ <span class='count'>(956 reviews)</span></div><div class='price'><s>$84.95</s>$69.95</div><div class='stock'>&nbsp;</div><button class='add-btn'>Add to Cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='thumb'>🧖</div><div class='card-body'><h3>Quick-Dry Hot Yoga Hand Towel — Non-Slip Corners</h3><div class='stars'>★★★★☆ <span class='count'>(642 reviews)</span></div><div class='price'>$14.95</div><div class='stock'>&nbsp;</div><button class='add-btn'>Add to Cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><span class='badge'>Save 25%</span><div class='thumb'>🪵</div><div class='card-body'><h3>Natural Cork Hot Yoga Mat — Antimicrobial, Sweat-Grip Surface</h3><div class='stars'>★★★★★ <span class='count'>(511 reviews)</span></div><div class='price'><s>$64.95</s>$49.95</div><div class='stock'>&nbsp;</div><button class='add-btn'>Add to Cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='thumb'>🧴</div><div class='card-body'><h3>Organic Yoga Mat Cleaner Spray — Tea Tree & Lavender, 8 oz</h3><div class='stars'>★★★★★ <span class='count'>(873 reviews)</span></div><div class='price'>$12.95</div><div class='stock'>💡 FREE with orders $99+ (code FREEGIFT99)</div><button class='add-btn'>Add to Cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='thumb'>🎒</div><div class='card-body'><h3>Extra Thick Hot Yoga Mat — 1/4\\\" Closed-Cell, Easy Clean</h3><div class='stars'>★★★★☆ <span class='count'>(438 reviews)</span></div><div class='price'><s>$39.95</s>$29.95</div><div class='stock'>&nbsp;</div><button class='add-btn'>Add to Cart</button></div></div></div><div class='bundle'><div><h3>Complete Your Hot Yoga Kit & Save 15%</h3><p>Bundle a non-slip mat + skidless towel + organic cleaner. Everything you need for heated class — and you unlock free shipping too.</p></div><a href='#products'>Build My Bundle →</a></div></main><section class='testimonials'><div class='container'><h2 class='section-title' style='margin-top:0'>Loved by Hot Yogis Everywhere</h2><p class='section-sub'>Real reviews from verified buyers</p><div class='t-grid'><div class='t-card'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>“Finally a mat that doesn't turn into a slip-and-slide in 105° Bikram. The grip literally improves as I sweat. Game changer.”</p><div class='who'>— Melissa R., Verified Buyer</div></div><div class='t-card'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>“The skidless towel stays perfectly in place through the entire 90-minute class. Washed it 20+ times and it's still like new.”</p><div class='who'>— Daniel K., Verified Buyer</div></div><div class='t-card'><div class='stars'>★★★★★</div><p>“Fast shipping, great prices, and the free cleaner promo was a nice bonus. YogaDirect is my go-to for studio gear.”</p><div class='who'>— Priya S., Studio Owner</div></div></div></div></section><section class='seo-copy container'><h2>Why You Need Dedicated Hot Yoga Gear</h2><p>Regular yoga mats become dangerously slippery in heated classes like Bikram, hot vinyasa and hot power yoga. Our hot yoga collection features moisture-activated surfaces — PU rubber, natural cork and skidless microfiber — that deliver <strong>more traction the more you sweat</strong>, so you can hold standing bow and eagle pose with total confidence.</p><p>Every hot yoga mat and towel we carry is quick-drying, easy to sanitize and built to survive daily heated practice. Pair your mat with a full-length skidless towel and an organic mat cleaner to keep your gear fresh, hygienic and studio-ready.</p></section><section class='faq container'><h2>Hot Yoga Gear FAQs</h2><details open><summary>What makes a yoga mat good for hot yoga?</summary><p>Hot yoga mats use moisture-activated grip surfaces such as PU rubber or cork, so traction actually improves as you sweat. They are also quick-drying, closed-cell and easy to sanitize after heated classes.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need a towel for hot yoga?</summary><p>Yes. A skidless mat towel absorbs sweat, prevents slipping and keeps studio mats hygienic. Most hot yoga studios recommend or require one — our full-length towels have non-slip grips so they stay put.</p></details><details><summary>How do I clean my hot yoga mat?</summary><p>Wipe your mat down after every heated class with an organic mat cleaner spray, then air dry flat. Machine wash mat towels in cold water and hang dry. Tip: orders $99+ get a free organic cleaner with code <strong>FREEGIFT99</strong>.</p></details><details><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><p>We offer 30-day easy returns on unused gear. Not the right grip or thickness? Send it back hassle-free.</p></details></section><section class='email-cap'><h2>Get 10% Off Your First Order</h2><p>Join 50,000+ yogis for exclusive deals, new gear drops and hot yoga tips.</p><form onsubmit=\\\"event.preventDefault();this.innerHTML='<p style=&quot;color:#ffb703;font-weight:700&quot;>✔ Check your inbox for your 10% code!</p>';\\\"><input type='email' required placeholder='Enter your email address' aria-label='Email address'><button type='submit'>Get My 10% Off</button></form></section><footer><div class='container cols'><div><h4>YogaDirect</h4><a href='https://www.yogadirect.com/aboutus.asp'>About Us</a><a href='https://www.yogadirect.com/contactus.asp'>Contact</a><a href=