ct painless. They accepted our purchase order and the gear has held up all year.\\\"</p><div class=\\\"who\\\">David R.</div><div class=\\\"role\\\">PE Coordinator, K-12 District</div></div><div class=\\\"tst\\\"><div class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</div><p>\\\"Best value we found for our corporate wellness program. The bulk discount applied right in the cart — no back-and-forth needed.\\\"</p><div class=\\\"who\\\">Priya K.</div><div class=\\\"role\\\">HR Wellness Lead</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\\\"grey\\\"><div class=\\\"container\\\"><h2 class=\\\"section-title\\\">Bulk Order FAQs</h2><div class=\\\"faq-list\\\"><details class=\\\"faq-item\\\"><summary>How do quantity discounts work?</summary><div class=\\\"a\\\">Discounts are applied automatically in your cart based on the total quantity of eligible items — 10% off at 10+ items, up to 25% off at 100+ items. No promo code needed.</div></details><details class=\\\"faq-item\\\"><summary>Can I mix and match different products to qualify?</summary><div class=\\\"a\\\">Yes! Combine mats, blocks, straps, bolsters and other eligible gear. Your total item count across all products determines your discount tier.</div></details><details class=\\\"faq-item\\\"><summary>How fast will my bulk order ship?</summary><div class=\\\"a\\\">Most in-stock bulk orders ship within 1–2 business days. Orders over $75 ship free. For very large orders, we'll confirm timing with your quote.</div></details><details class=\\\"faq-item\\\"><summary>Do you accept purchase orders from schools and institutions?</summary><div class=\\\"a\\\">Yes — we accept POs from schools, universities, hospitals and government organizations. Use the quote form above or call 1-800-331-8233 to get started.</div></details><details class=\\\"faq-item\\\"><summary>What if something arrives damaged or isn't right?</summary><div class=\\\"a\\\">Every order is backed by our 100% satisfaction guarantee. Contact us and we'll make it right with a replaceme