day ship within 24 hours</div><ul class=\\\"key-benefits\\\"><li><strong>Perfect fit:</strong> 55-65cm sizing for people 5'7\\\" to 6' tall</li><li><strong>Slip-free:</strong> textured, sticky surface grips even through heavy perspiration</li><li><strong>Anti-burst safety:</strong> extra-thick vinyl deflates slowly if punctured — never pops like a balloon</li><li><strong>Rock solid:</strong> holds up to 600 pounds of pressure</li><li><strong>Versatile:</strong> Pilates, resistance training, stretching — even doubles as an office chair</li></ul><span class=\\\"option-label\\\">Choose Your Color:</span><div class=\\\"swatches\\\"><div class=\\\"swatch blue selected\\\" data-color=\\\"Blue\\\" title=\\\"Blue\\\" onclick=\\\"selectColor(this)\\\"></div><div class=\\\"swatch purple\\\" data-color=\\\"Purple\\\" title=\\\"Purple\\\" onclick=\\\"selectColor(this)\\\"></div><div class=\\\"swatch green\\\" data-color=\\\"Green\\\" title=\\\"Green\\\" onclick=\\\"selectColor(this)\\\"></div><div class=\\\"swatch black\\\" data-color=\\\"Black\\\" title=\\\"Black\\\" onclick=\\\"selectColor(this)\\\"></div></div><div class=\\\"swatch-name\\\">Selected: <span id=\\\"colorName\\\">Blue</span></div><div class=\\\"upsell\\\"><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" id=\\\"addPump\\\"><label for=\\\"addPump\\\"><strong>Complete your setup:</strong> Add a Hand Pump for only <span class=\\\"up-price\\\">$4.99</span> <s>$7.99</s><br><small>A pump is required to inflate your ball — save time and money by bundling now.</small></label></div><div class=\\\"qty-row\\\"><input type=\\\"number\\\" value=\\\"1\\\" min=\\\"1\\\" aria-label=\\\"Quantity\\\" id=\\\"qty\\\"><button class=\\\"btn-cart\\\" onclick=\\\"addToCart()\\\">Add to Cart</button></div><div class=\\\"trust-row\\\"><div><span class=\\\"ico\\\">🔒</span>Secure Checkout</div><div><span class=\\\"ico\\\">↩️</span>30-Day Easy Returns</div><div><span class=\\\"ico\\\">🚚</span>Fast Shipping</div><div><span class=\\\"ico\\\">⭐</span>Trusted Since 1999</div></div><div class=\\\"reward\\\">🎁 Earn <strong>31.98 reward points</strong> with this purchase — redeem on your next order.</div><div class=\\\"bulk\\\"><strong>Buy More, Save More — Wholesale Pricing:</strong><table><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Price Each</th><th>You Save</th></tr><tr><td>1 – 3</td><td>$15.99</td><td>36% off retail</td></tr><tr><td>4 – 11</td><td>$15.49</td><td>38% off retail</td></tr><tr class=\\\"best\\\"><td>12+ <span style=\\\"color:#e2453c\\\">(Best Value)</span></td><td>$14.99</td><td>40% off retail</td></tr></table></div><div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#777\\\">Part Number: YP41ABLXXX65</div></div></div><div class=\\\"size-guide\\\" id=\\\"size-guide\\\"><strong style=\\\"font-size:17px\\\">📏 Not sure this is your size? Quick Size Guide</strong><table><tr><th>Your Height</th><th>Recommended Ball</th><th></th></tr><tr><td>Under 5'7\\\"</td><td>45-55cm Yoga Ball</td><td><a href=\\\"/45cm-anti-burst-deluxe-yoga-ball.html\\\">Shop 45-55cm →</a></td></tr><tr class=\\\"current\\\"><td>5'7\\\" – 6'0\\\"</td><td>55-65cm Yoga Ball (this product ✓)</td><td>You're in the right place</td></tr><tr><td>6'0\\\" – 6'5\\\"</td><td>65-75cm Yoga Ball</td><td><a href=\\\"/75cm-anti-burst-deluxe-yoga-ball.html\\\">Shop 65-75cm →</a></td></tr><tr><td>Over 6'5\\\"</td><td>75-85cm Yoga Ball</td><td><a href=\\\"/85cm-anti-burst-deluxe-yoga-ball.html\\\">Shop 75-85cm →</a></td></tr></table></div><section class=\\\"desc\\\"><h2>Why Thousands Choose the Yoga Direct Deluxe Yoga Ball</h2><p>Looking to kick your fitness routine up a notch? Get the ball rolling with Yoga Direct's 55-65 cm Yoga Ball! The yoga ball has a laundry list of alternate aliases: physio ball, swiss ball, Pilates ball, exercise ball, or fitness ball — they are all the same! Our 55-65cm ball is the right size for people that are 5'7\\\" to six feet tall. A smaller 45-55cm yoga ball or a larger 65-75cm or 75-85cm ball is also available.</p><p>Use yoga balls for Pilates, resistance training, floor work, and stretching to add variety and raise the difficulty of exercise routines. They also double as an office chair! Our 65cm ball comes in 4 colors and is designed for maximum safety with a textured, sticky surface so you won't slip from under the ball even through heavy perspiration. Made from thick and anti-burst vinyl, it is durable and won't pop like a balloon if it's ever punctured.</p><p>A hand or foot pump is necessary to inflate (sold separately — <strong>add one above and save</strong>). This item is priced wholesale. Own a studio or gym? We also sell <a href=\\\"/fitness-ball-racks\\\">fitness ball racks</a> as an attractive solution to yoga ball storage.</p></section><div class=\\\"faq\\\"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><details open><summary>What size yoga ball should I buy?</summary><p>The 55-65cm ball is ideal if you're between 5'7\\\" and 6' tall. When seated on the fully inflated ball, your knees should be at roughly a 90° angle. See our size guide above for other heights.</p></details><details><summary>Does it come with a pump?</summary><p>A pump is sold separately, but you can add a discounted hand pump to your order above and have everything you need in one delivery.</p></details><details><summary>Is it really anti-burst?</summary><p>Yes. The extra-thick vinyl is engineered to deflate slowly if punctured instead of popping — a critical safety feature, especially when used as a desk chair or with weights.</p></details><details><summary>How much weight can it hold?</summary><p>The Deluxe Yoga Ball holds up to 600 pounds of pressure, making it suitable for exercise, physical therapy, and all-day sitting.</p></details><details><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><p>We offer 30-day hassle-free returns. If you're not completely satisfied, contact us and we'll make it right.</p></details></div><div class=\\\"reviews\\\" id=\\\"reviews\\\"><h2>Customer Reviews <span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span> <span style=\\\"font-size:14px;color:#777\\\">4.8 out of 5 · 5 reviews</span></h2><div class=\\\"review\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span><h3>Great quality, doesn't slip</h3><p>The textured surface really works — no sliding even during sweaty workouts. Feels much thicker than cheaper balls I've owned.</p><div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"verified\\\">✓ Verified Buyer</span></div></div><div class=\\\"review\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span><h3>Perfect as an office chair</h3><p>I sit on this all day at my desk. Sturdy, holds air well, and my back feels better.</p><div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"verified\\\">✓ Verified Buyer</span></div></div><div class=\\\"review\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★☆</span><h3>Solid ball, buy the pump</h3><p>Very durable and well made. Just note you'll need a pump — get one with your order.</p><div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"verified\\\">✓ Verified Buyer</span></div></div><p style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\"><a href=\\\"#\\\">Read all 5 reviews</a> · <a href=\\\"#\\\">Write a Review</a></p></div><div class=\\\"cross\\\"><h2>Complete Your Setup</h2><div class=\\\"cross-grid\\\"><div class=\\\"cross-card\\\"><div class=\\\"ph\\\">Hand Pump</div><a href=\\\"/hand-pump.html\\\">Hand Pump for Yoga Balls</a><div class=\\\"p\\\">$7.99</div></div><div class=\\\"cross-card\\\"><div class=\\\"ph\\\">Ball Rack</div><a href=\\\"/fitness-ball-racks\\\">Fitness Ball Storage Rack</a><div class=\\\"p\\\">From $39.99</div></div><div class=\\\"cross-card\\\"><div class=\\\"ph\\\">45-55cm Ball</div><a href=\\\"/45cm-anti-burst-deluxe-yoga-ball.html\\\">45-55cm Deluxe Yoga Ball</a><div class=\\\"p\\\">$13.99</div></div><div class=\\\"cross-card\\\"><div class=\\\"ph\\\">75-85cm Ball</div><a href=\\\"/85cm-anti-burst-deluxe-yoga-ball.html\\\">75-85cm Deluxe Yoga Ball</a><div class=\\\"p\\\">$18.99</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\\\"guarantee-band\\\"><h2>💯 Our 30-Day Satisfaction Guarantee</h2><p>Love your yoga ball or return it within 30 days f