aps</th></tr>\\n<tr><td>Feel on skin</td><td>Soft, textured, non-slip</td><td>Rug burn, rashes</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>Material</td><td>100% natural cotton</td><td>Synthetic nylon</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>Dyes</td><td>Phthalate &amp; heavy-metal free</td><td>Often untested</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>Buckle</td><td>Easy-adjust cinch, durable under pressure</td><td>Stiff D-rings that slip</td></tr>\\n</table>\\n</section>\\n<section class='block faq'>\\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\\n<details><summary>Is 8 feet the right length for me?</summary><p>8 feet suits most practitioners, including taller yogis and anyone wanting extra length for seated forward folds, shoulder openers, and bound poses. If you prefer a shorter strap, we also offer a 6 ft version.</p></details>\\n<details><summary>Will the plastic buckle hold under tension?</summary><p>Yes. The cinch buckle is lightweight but extremely durable under pressure, and it adjusts quickly mid-pose without slipping.</p></details>\\n<details><summary>Is the strap safe for sensitive skin?</summary><p>Absolutely. It's 100% soft cotton with phthalate and heavy-metal-free dyes &mdash; no nylon rug burn or irritation.</p></details>\\n<details><summary>Do you offer studio or bulk pricing?</summary><p>Yes &mdash; pay just $7.99 each for 4&ndash;11 straps and $7.49 each for 12 or more. Discounts apply automatically in your cart.</p></details>\\n<details><summary>What if it's not right for me?</summary><p>Every order is backed by our 30-day hassle-free return policy. Contact us at 1-800-431-9642 and we'll make it right.</p></details>\\n</section>\\n<section class='block' id='reviews'>\\n<h2>Customer Reviews (7) &mdash; 4.9/5 Average</h2>\\n<div class='review'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><h3>Soft on hands, buckle holds firm</h3><p>I switched from a nylon strap that gave me rug burn. This cotton one is night and day &mdash; soft but grippy, and the buckle never slips.</p><p class='meta'>Verified Buyer</p></