\n\\n      <div class=\\\"price-row\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"price\\\">$10.49</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"save-badge\\\">Bulk: as low as $8.49/each</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"stock\\\"><span class=\\\"dot\\\"></span>In Stock — Ships within 1 business day</p>\\n\\n      <ul class=\\\"features\\\">\\n        <li><strong>8&#39; Long x 1.5&quot; Wide</strong> — the ideal length for most yogis</li>\\n        <li><strong>100% extra-thick durable cotton</strong> with textured non-slip surface</li>\\n        <li><strong>Heavy-duty metal D-Ring buckle</strong> that won&#39;t bend or break</li>\\n        <li><strong>Quick one-hand adjustments</strong> — even mid-pose</li>\\n        <li><strong>5 classic colors</strong> to match your practice</li>\\n      </ul>\\n\\n      <form action=\\\"/cart/add\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n        <fieldset class=\\\"options\\\">\\n          <legend>Color: <span id=\\\"colorName\\\">Purple</span></legend>\\n          <div class=\\\"swatches\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"swatch selected\\\" style=\\\"background:#6a4fa3\\\" title=\\\"Purple\\\"><input type=\\\"radio\\\" name=\\\"color\\\" value=\\\"purple\\\" checked aria-label=\\\"Purple\\\"></label>\\n            <label class=\\\"swatch\\\" style=\\\"background:#2b5fad\\\" title=\\\"Blue\\\"><input type=\\\"radio\\\" name=\\\"color\\\" value=\\\"blue\\\" aria-label=\\\"Blue\\\"></label>\\n            <label class=\\\"swatch\\\" style=\\\"background:#222\\\" title=\\\"Black\\\"><input type=\\\"radio\\\" name=\\\"color\\\" value=\\\"black\\\" aria-label=\\\"Black\\\"></label>\\n            <label class=\\\"swatch\\\" style=\\\"background:#2e7d5b\\\" title=\\\"Green\\\"><input type=\\\"radio\\\" name=\\\"color\\\" value=\\\"green\\\" aria-label=\\\"Green\\\"></label>\\n            <label class=\\\"swatch\\\" style=\\\"background:#b03030\\\" title=\\\"Red\\\"><input type=\\\"radio\\\" name=\\\"color\\\" value=\\\"red\\\" aria-label=\\\"Red\\\"></label>\\n          </div>\\n        </fieldset>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"qty-row\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"qty\\\">Quantity</label>\\n          <input type=\\\"number\\\" id=\\\"qty\\\" name=\\\"quantity\\\" value=\\\"1\\\" min=\\\"1\\\" inputmode=\\\"numeric\\\">\\n          <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn-cart\\\">Add to Cart — $10.49</button>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\\\"microcopy\\\">✔ 30-day money-back guarantee &nbsp; ✔ Easy returns &nbsp; ✔ Secure checkout</p>\\n      </form>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"trust-badges\\\">\\n        <span>🚚 Fast, low-cost shipping</span>\\n        <span>🔒 SSL secure payment</span>\\n        <span>↩️ Hassle-free returns</span>\\n        <span>🏆 Studio-quality gear since 2001</span>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"bulk\\\" id=\\\"bulk-pricing\\\">\\n        <h2>💰 Buy More, Save More — Perfect for Studios &amp; Teachers</h2>\\n        <table>\\n          <thead><tr><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Quantity</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">Price / Strap</th><th scope=\\\"col\\\">You Save</th></tr></thead>\\n          <tbody>\\n            <tr><td>1 – 11</td><td>$10.49</td><td>—</td></tr>\\n            <tr><td>12 – 49</td><td>$9.99</td><td class=\\\"save\\\">Save 5%</td></tr>\\n            <tr><td>50 – 99</td><td>$9.49</td><td class=\\\"save\\\">Save 10%</td></tr>\\n            <tr><td>100+</td><td><strong>$8.49</strong></td><td class=\\\"save\\\">Save 19%</td></tr>\\n          </tbody>\\n        </table>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"rewards\\\">🎁 <strong>Earn 20.98 reward points</strong> with this purchase — redeem on your next order.</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Description -->\\n  <section class=\\\"desc\\\">\\n    <h2>Why Yogis Love This Strap</h2>\\n    <p>Here&#39;s an easy-to-use yoga strap that will stay in place and is easy to adjust on the fly. The 8 Foot Yoga Strap with D-Ring Buckle is made from extra thick, durable cotton that is manufactured with a textured surface so it won&#39;t slip off your foot or out of your hand!</p>\\n    <p>Eight feet is more than enough length for most yogis. The D-Ring is made from thick metal that won&#39;t bend or break, and the buckle is designed for effortless adjustments in balancing poses. Straps are crucial to any yogi&#39;s practice for improving alignment and flexibility — deepen stretches safely, hold poses longer, and progress faster.</p>\\n    <p>Need a different length? This strap also comes in a shorter <a href=\\\"https://www.yogadirect.com/yoga-strap-d-ring-6-ft.html\\\">6 Foot version</a> or a longer <a href=\\\"https://www.yogadirect.com/yoga-strap-d-ring-10-ft.html\\\">10 Foot version</a>.</p>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <!-- Cross-sell -->\\n  <section class=\\\"cross\\\">\\n    <h2>Complete Your Practice</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"cross-grid\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"cross-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">6 Ft D-Ring Yoga Strap</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"title\\\" href=\\\"https://www.yogadirect.com/yoga-strap-d-ring-6-ft.html\\\">6 Ft D-Ring Yoga Strap</a>\\n        <div class=\\\"p\\\">From $8.99</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn-sm\\\" href=\\\"https://www.yogadirect.com/yoga-strap-d-ring-6-ft.html\\\">View</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"cross-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">10 Ft D-Ring Yoga Strap</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"title\\\" href=\\\"https://www.yogadirect.com/yoga-strap-d-ring-10-ft.html\\\">10 Ft D-Ring Yoga Strap</a>\\n        <div class=\\\"p\\\">From $11.99</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn-sm\\\" href=\\\"https://www.yogadirect.com/yoga-strap-d-ring-10-ft.html\\\">View</a>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"cross-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"thumb\\\">Foam Yoga Block</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"title\\\" href=\\\"https://www.yogadirect.com/yoga-blocks.html\\\">Foam Yoga Blocks</a>\\n        <div class=\\\"p\\\">Pairs perfectly with straps</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn-sm\\\" href=\\\"https://www.yogadirect.com/yoga-blocks.html\\\">View</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <!-- Reviews -->\\n  <section class=\\\"reviews\\\" id=\\\"reviews\\\">\\n    <h2>⭐ 4.8 / 5 — Rated by 32 Verified Buyers</h2>\\n    <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">★★★★★</div>\\n      <p>\\\"Perfect length and the texture really does keep it from slipping. The D-ring holds tight even in deep stretches.\\\"</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"who\\\">— Sarah M. · <span class=\\\"verified\\\">✔ Verified Buyer</span></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">★★★★★</div>\\n      <p>\\\"Bought 50 for my studio at the bulk price. Great quality for the cost — students love them.\\\"</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"who\\\">— Studio Owner, TX · <span class=\\\"verified\\\">✔ Verified Buyer</span></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"review\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"stars\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">★★★★☆</div>\\n      <p>\\\"Sturdy cotton, easy to adjust mid-pose. Exactly what I needed for hamstring work.\\\"</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"who\\\">— David R. · <span class=\\\"verified\\\">✔ Verified Buyer</span></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <a class=\\\"btn-outline\\\" href=\\\"#write-review\\\" id=\\\"write-review\\\">Write a Review</a>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <!-- FAQ -->\\n  <section class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>Which strap length is right for me?</summary>\\n      <p>8 feet is the most versatile length and works for most yogis. Choose the 6 ft version if you&#39;re petite or want less excess strap, or the 10 ft version if you&#39;re tall or practice restorative/bound poses.</p>\\n    </details>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>Will the D-ring buckle slip during poses?</summary>\\n      <p>No — the thick metal D-ring locks the textured cotton firmly in place, yet still allows quick one-hand adjustments on the fly.</p>\\n    </details>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>How do I care for my strap?</summary>\\n      <p>The 100% cotton strap can be spot-cleaned or hand-washed with mild soap and air dried.</p>\\n    </details>\\n    <details>\\n      <summary>Do you offer studio / bulk discounts?</summary>\\n      <p>Yes! Save automatically at checkout: $9.99 each for 12–49, $9.49 for 50–99, and just $8.49 each for 100+.</p>\\n    </details>\\n  </section>\\n</div>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <p>© YogaDirect. All rights reserved. &nbsp;|&nbsp; 🔒 Secure Checkout &nbsp;|&nbsp; 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee</p>\\n  </div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n<!-- Sticky mobile add-to-cart -->\\n<div class=\\\"sticky-cta\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"false\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"inner\\\">\\n    <span class=\\\"p\\\">$10.49</span>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" onclick=\\\"document.querySelector('.btn-cart').click()\\\">Add to Cart</button>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<script>\\n  // Color swatch selection + name display\\n  document.querySelectorAll('.swatch input').forEach(function(input){\\n    input.addEventListener('change', function(){\\n      document.querySelectorAll('.swatch').forEach(function(s){s.classList.remove('selected');});\\n      input.closest('.swatch').classList.add('selected');\\n      var name = input.value.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+input.value.slice(1);\\n      document.getElementById('colorName').textContent = name;\\n    });\\n  });\\n  // Dynamic CTA price based on quantity tiers\\n  var tiers=[[100,8.49],[50,9.49],[12,9.99],[1,10.49]];\\n  var qtyEl=document.getElementById('qty'), btn=document.querySelector('.btn-cart'), stickyP=document.querySelector('.sticky-cta .p');\\n  function updatePrice(){\\n    var q=parseInt(qtyEl.value,10)||1, unit=10.49;\\n    for(var i=0;i<tiers.length;i++){if(q>=tiers[i][0]){unit=tiers[i][1];break;}}\\n    var total=(q*unit).toFixed(2);\\n    btn.textContent='Add to Cart — $'+total+(q>1?' ($'+unit.toFixed(2)+'/ea)':'');\\n    stickyP.textContent='$'+total;\\n  }\\n  qtyEl.addEventListener('input',updatePrice);\\n</script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\", \"improvements\": [{\"What\": \"Added Product JSON-LD structured data with price, availability, SKU and aggregate rating (4.8/32 reviews).\", \"Why\": \"Enables rich snippets (stars + price) in Google search results, which significantly increases organic click-through rate and qualified traffic.\", \"Hash\": \"a1f3c9e2\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a prominent orange 'Add to Cart' button with dynamic total pricing that updates as quantity changes, plus a sticky mobile add-to-cart bar.\", \"Why\": \"A high-contrast, always-visible CTA reduces friction and abandonment, especially on mobile where over half of traffic converts poorly when the CTA scrolls out of view.\", \"Hash\": \"b7d21e04\"}, {\"What\": \"Restructured the bulk pricing table with explicit 'You Save' percentages (up to 19%) and linked it from a top announcement bar targeting studios.\", \"Why\": \"Making volume savings explicit increases average order value by nudging teachers/studios toward higher quantity tiers.\", \"Hash\": \"c58f7a11\"}, {\"What\": \"Added trust signals: in-stock/fast-shipping messaging, 30-day money-back guarantee, secure checkout badges, and verified-buyer review excerpts near the buy box.\", \"Why\": \"Trust and risk-reversal cues address the primary hesitation points for first-time buyers, lifting add-to-cart and checkout completion rates.\", \"Hash\": \"d94b3f6c\"}, {\"What\": \"Converted the plain feature list into scannable benefit-driven bullets (e.g., 'won't bend or break', 'one-hand adjustments mid-pose') and rewrote description copy around outcomes like deeper stretches and faster progress.\", \"Why\": \"Benefit-focused copy converts better than spec lists because shoppers buy outcomes, not materials.\", \"Hash\": \"e2c60a8d\"}, {\"What\": \"Added interactive color swatches with selected-color label and accessible radio inputs.\", \"Why\": \"Visual option selection reduces choice friction versus dropdowns and l