\\"></span>In Stock — Ships within 1 business day</div><div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:#666;margin-top:4px\\\">Buying 6+? Prices drop to as low as <strong>$13.89/mat</strong> — <a href=\\\"#bulk\\\">see bulk pricing</a></div></div><div class=\\\"opt-label\\\">Choose Your Design:</div><div class=\\\"swatches\\\" role=\\\"radiogroup\\\" aria-label=\\\"Mat design\\\"><label class=\\\"swatch selected\\\"><input type=\\\"radio\\\" name=\\\"design\\\" value=\\\"sun\\\" checked><span class=\\\"chip\\\" style=\\\"background:#f39c12\\\"></span>Smiling Sun<br>(Orange)</label><label class=\\\"swatch\\\"><input type=\\\"radio\\\" name=\\\"design\\\" value=\\\"butterflies\\\"><span class=\\\"chip\\\" style=\\\"background:#8e44ad\\\"></span>Butterflies<br>(Purple)</label><label class=\\\"swatch\\\"><input type=\\\"radio\\\" name=\\\"design\\\" value=\\\"turtles\\\"><span class=\\\"chip\\\" style=\\\"background:#2980b9\\\"></span>Turtles<br>(Blue)</label></div><form class=\\\"qty-row\\\" action=\\\"/cart/add\\\" method=\\\"post\\\"><input type=\\\"number\\\" name=\\\"qty\\\" value=\\\"1\\\" min=\\\"1\\\" aria-label=\\\"Quantity\\\"><button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn-cart\\\">Add to Cart 🛒</button></form><div class=\\\"guarantee\\\"><span>🔒 Secure Checkout</span><span>↩️ 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee</span><span>🚚 Free Shipping Over $50</span></div><div class=\\\"badges\\\"><div class=\\\"badge\\\"><span class=\\\"ico\\\">🧒</span>Kid-Safe: Free of the 6 Most Harmful Phthalates</div><div class=\\\"badge\\\"><span class=\\\"ico\\\">🚫</span>No Heavy Metals</div><div class=\\\"badge\\\"><span class=\\\"ico\\\">🤸</span>Non-Slip Textured Surface</div></div><div class=\\\"rewards\\\">⭐ Earn <strong>17 Reward Points</strong> with this purchase — redeem for discounts on your next order!</div><ul class=\\\"features\\\"><li><strong>Perfect kid size:</strong> 60\\\" L x 24\\\" W x 1/8\\\" thick</li><li>Same width and thickness as our regular yoga mat, just shorter</li><li>Cushy 1/8\\\" thickness — great for tumbling and play</li><li>Whimsical, kid-friendly colors and designs</li></ul></div></div><section class=\\\"section\\\"><h2>Why Kids (and Parents) Love This Mat</h2><p>Yoga for kids is becoming increasingly popular, with kids yoga classes popping up everywhere — at yoga studios, in gyms, and even in schools! Our Kids Yoga Mat is 1/8\\\" thick and as wide as our deluxe yoga mat at 24 inches. Your children will love our whimsical design themes and want to tumble around on one: smiling sun (orange), butterflies (purple), or turtles (blue). These yoga mats for kids are cushy and thick for those who like to play around on the mat.</p><p style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Kids yoga has tremendous benefits for the child. Yoga practitioners everywhere know that yoga helps slow down the practitioner and improve concentration. It makes perfect sense to help a child find his or her center. The trick: you have to make it fun and approachable. We did both with our Kids Yoga Mat. Created with kid-friendly animals and colors, your child can have a blast mimicking their favorite animal poses. Give your child a mat that's just their size. <strong>By making yoga fun for a child, you create a lifelong joyful habit.</strong></p></section><section class=\\\"section\\\" id=\\\"bulk\\\"><h2>Bulk &amp; Wholesale Pricing — Perfect for Schools &amp; Studios</h2><p style=\\\"margin-bottom:14px\\\">Wholesale pricing automatically updates in your cart. Cannot be combined with other discounts or promotions.</p><table class=\\\"pricing\\\"><thead><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Price Per Mat</th><th>You Save</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>6 – 23</td><td>$15.99</td><td class=\\\"save-tag\\\">Save 6%</td></tr><tr><td>24 – 119</td><td>$14.89</td><td class=\\\"save-tag\\\">Save 12%</td></tr><tr><td>120+</td><td>$13.89</td><td class=\\\"save-tag\\\">Save 18%</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">Outfitting a classroom or studio? <a href=\\\"/contact\\\"><strong>Contact our wholesale team</strong></a> for a custom quote.</p></section><section class=\\\"section\\\" id=\\\"reviews\\\"><h2>Rated ★★★★★ by Parents</h2><div class=\\\"review\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span><h4>Kids Sun Yoga Mat</h4><p>Great yoga mat. My 4 year old loves it!</p><div class=\\\"meta\\\">Reviewed from North Carolina on 9/13/2016</div></div><div class=\\\"review\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span><h4>Perfect size for kids</h4><p>I have purchased 2 of my girls these mats, ages 3 and 6. They love them, and they are the perfect size to fit the child's needs. Love them... Thanks!</p><div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"verified\\\">✔ Verified Buyer</span> · Reviewed from Havre on 5/21/2015</div></div><div class=\\\"review\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span><h4>Both my kids love them!</h4><p>Bought the turtle and butterfly ones for my kids. They are large and thick and both of my kids love them! They love doing yoga!</p><div class=\\\"meta\\\">Reviewed from Arcadia on 3/31/2015</div></div><div class=\\\"review\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span><h4>CUTE yoga mats</h4><p>I got the turtle and sun mats for my 3 and 5 year old. They are adorable mats with bright colors. My children cannot get enough of them. \\\"Mommy, is it yoga yet?\\\"</p><div class=\\\"meta\\\">Reviewed from Chicago on 1/20/2015</div></div><div class=\\\"review\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span><h4>Adorable and perfect thickness</h4><p>The print of the turtles was adorable and the thickness of the mat was perfect!</p><div class=\\\"meta\\\">Reviewed on 9/15/2014</div></div></section><section class=\\\"section faq\\\"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><details><summary>Is this mat safe for young children?</summary><p>Yes! This mat is free from the 6 most harmful phthalates and contains no heavy metals, making it a kid-safe choice for children of all ages.</p></details><details><summary>What size is the kids yoga mat?</summary><p>It measures 60\\\" long x 24\\\" wide x 1/8\\\" thick — the same width and thickness as our regular yoga mat, just shorter and perfectly sized for kids.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer discounts for schools and studios?</summary><p>Absolutely. Quantity pricing starts at just 6 mats and drops to $13.89/mat at 120+. Wholesale pricing applies automatically in your cart.</p></details><details><summary>How do I clean the mat?</summary><p>Simply wipe with a damp cloth and mild soap, then air dry away from direct sunlight.</p></details><details><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><p>We offer 30-day easy returns. If you or your child aren't happy, we'll make it right.</p></details></section><section class=\\\"section\\\"><h2>Complete Your Practice With</h2><div class=\\\"cross\\\"><div class=\\\"card\\\"><img src=\\\"/images/kids-yoga-blocks.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Kids foam yoga blocks\\\"><div>Kids Foam Yoga Block</div><div class=\\\"p\\\">$8.99</div><button>Add to Cart</button></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><img src=\\\"/images/yoga-mat-bag.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Yoga mat carry bag\\\"><div>Yoga Mat Carry Bag</div><div class=\\\"p\\\">$12.99</div><button>Add to Cart</button></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><img src=\\\"/images/yoga-strap.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Cotton yoga strap\\\"><div>Cotton Yoga Strap 6'</div><div class=\\\"p\\\">$6.99</div><button>Add to Cart</button></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><img src=\\\"/images/eye-pillow.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Lavender eye pillow\\\"><div>Lavender Eye Pillow</div><div class=\\\"p\\\">$9.99</div><button>Add to Cart</button></div></div></section></main><div class=\\\"sticky-cta\\\"><div><div style=\\\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700\\\">Fun Yoga Mat For Kids</div><span class=\\\"p\\\">$16.99</span> <span style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:#999;text-decoration:line-through\\\">$21.99</span></div><button class=\\\"btn-cart\\\" onclick=\\\"document.querySelector('.qty-row button').click()\\\">Add to Cart</button></div><footer><div class=\\\"container\\\"><div><h4>YogaDirect</h4><p>Quality yoga gear at direct prices<br>since 2001.</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href=\\\"/yoga-mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/kids-yoga\\\">Kids Yoga</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Support</h4><ul><li><a href=\\\"/shipping\\\">Shipping &amp; Returns</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact Us</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/rewards\\\">Reward Points</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Guarantee</h4><p>🔒 Secure Checkout<br>↩️ 30-Day Returns<br>🚚 Free Shipping Over $50</p></div></div></footer><script>function swapImg(t,src){document.getElementById('mainImg').src=src}document.querySelectorAll('.swatch').forEach(function(s){s.addEventListener('click',function(){document.querySelectorAll('.swatch').forEach(function(x){x.classList.remove('selected')});s.classList.add('selected')})});</script></body></html>\", \"improvements\": [{\"What\": \"Added a prominent, high-contrast 'Add to Cart' button with quantity selector directly beside the price and design options above the fold.\", \"Why\": \"A clear, single primary CTA above the fold is one of the highest-impact conversion levers; the original page buried the purchase action behind 'Choose Options'.\", \"Hash\": \"35bb514b\"}, {\"What\": \"Displayed concrete pricing with strikethrough retail price, sale price, and a 'SAVE 23%' badge, plus an in-stock/fast-shipping indicator.\", \"Why\": \"The original page showed empty 'Retail Price / On sale / You Save' fields. Visible price anchoring and savings percentages increase perceived value, and stock/shipping urgency reduces purchase hesitation.\", \"Hash\": \"af28b277\"}, {\"What\": \"Added trust badges highlighting kid-safety (phthalate-free, no heavy metals, non-slip) and purchase guarantees (secure checkout, 30-day returns, free shipping threshold) near the CTA.\", \"Why\": \"For a children's product, safety reassurance is the primary parental objection; placing trust signals adjacent to the buy button reduces anxiety at the decision moment. The free-shipping-over-$50 threshold also nudges larger cart sizes.\", \"Hash\": \"96ecbdd7\"}, {\"What\": \"Converted design options into visual color swatches (Smiling Sun/Orange, Butterflies/Purple, Turtles/Blue) with image gallery thumbnails per design.\", \"Why\": \"Visual option selection reduces friction and errors versus dropdowns, and letting parents preview each design increases engagement and confidence, lifting add-to-cart rates.\", \"Hash\": \"f2914e35\"}, {\"What\": \"Restructured the quantity pricing into a clear table with 'You Save %' column, added a wholesale CTA for schools/studios, and linked to it from the price box ('Buying 6+? … see bulk pricing').\", \"Why\": \"B2B/bulk buyers (schools, studios) are a high-revenue segment; making tiered savings explicit and easy to act on increases average order value significantly.\", \"Hash\": \"514ecc37\"}, {\"What\": \"Moved the five 5-star reviews into a formatted, scannable review section with star icons, headlines, and 'Verified Buyer' labels, linked from a rating summary next to the product title, plus Product/AggregateRating structured data (JSON-LD).\", \"Why\": \"Social proof near the title and CTA is a proven conversion driver, and structured data enables rich star snippets in Google results, improving organic click-through rates and traffic.\", \"Hash\": \"b75733ca\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a sticky mobile add-to-cart bar showing product name, price, and buy button.\", \"Why\": \"On mobile, users scroll past the CTA while reading reviews and details; a persistent CTA recovers those visitors and typically lifts mobile conversion measurably.\", \"Hash\": \"ce1385d4\"}, {\"What\": \"Added an FAQ section answering safety, sizing, cleaning, returns, and bulk-discount questions.\", \"Why\": \"Answering common objections on-page prevents abandonment to search/support channels and captures long-tail SEO queries from parents researching kid-safe mats.\", \"Hash\": \"da75cd65\"}