'>Yoga Props</a> / <a href='/eye-pillows'>Eye Pillows</a> / Small Cotton Eye Pillow (Natural)</nav><div class='grid'><div class='imgwrap'><img src='/images/products/small-cotton-eye-pillow-natural.jpg' alt='Small natural cotton eye pillow filled with organic flax seeds, 4 by 8 inches, with removable washable cover' width='520' height='420' loading='eager'></div><div><h1>Small Cotton Eye Pillow (Natural)</h1><p class='sub'>100% cotton &bull; Organic flax seed fill &bull; Removable washable cover &bull; 4&quot; x 8&quot;</p><div class='ratingrow'><span class='stars' aria-label='Rated 4.7 out of 5 stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><a href='#reviews'>4.7 (3 reviews)</a> &bull; <span>Loved by yoga instructors</span></div><div class='pricebox'><span class='retail'>Retail $9.99</span><div><span class='price'>$7.99</span><span class='save'>You save $2.00 (20%)</span></div><p class='stock'><span></span>In stock &ndash; ships within 24 hours</p></div><form action='/cart/add' method='post'><label for='scent'>Choose your option</label><select id='scent' name='option' required><option value='unscented' selected>Unscented (allergy-friendly)</option><option value='lavender'>Lavender scented</option></select><label for='qty'>Quantity</label><input type='number' id='qty' name='qty' value='1' min='1'><input type='hidden' name='sku' value='YP42EYEXXXCU'><button type='submit' class='cta'>Add to Cart &ndash; $7.99</button><p class='microcopy'>&#128274; Secure checkout &bull; 30-day hassle-free returns &bull; Buying 10 or more? Bulk pricing applies automatically in your cart.</p></form><div class='badges'><div>&#128666; Fast shipping</div><div>&#127807; Organic flax seed fill</div><div>&#129532; 100% cotton</div><div>&#128257; Easy returns</div></div><div class='points'>&#11088; Earn <b>8 reward points</b> with this purchase &ndash; redeem for savings on your next order.</div></div></div><section id='bulk'><h2>Studio &amp; Wholesale Pricing</h2><p style='margin-bottom:12px'>Outfitting a studio? Wholesale pricing updates automatically in your cart &ndash; no code needed. (Cannot be combined with other discounts or promotions.)</p><table><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Price per pillow</th><th>Your savings</th></tr><tr><td>1 &ndash; 9</td><td>$7.99</td><td>&ndash;</td></tr><tr><td>10 &ndash; 49</td><td>$6.99</td><td>Save 13%</td></tr><tr class='hl'><td>50+</td><td>$6.49</td><td>Save 19% &ndash; best value</td></tr></table></section><section id='details'><h2>Why You&rsquo;ll Love It</h2><ul class='bullets'><li><b>Organic flax seed fill</b>Gentle, even weight that eases eye tension and calms the nervous system.</li><li><b>100% pure cotton</b>Soft, breathable and naturally hypoallergenic &ndash; ideal for sensitive skin.</li><li><b>Removable washable cover</b>Perfect for studio use; launder between classes with ease.</li><li><b>Perfect travel size (4&quot; x 8&quot;)</b>Wide enough to fully block light, small enough for any yoga bag.</li></ul><p>Enjoy savasana with our Small Cotton Eye Pillow, filled with natural organic flax seeds. Made from 100% pure cotton, the soft shape contours to your face with gentle pressure while blocking out exterior light. Perfect for deep relaxation, meditation and savasana &ndash; and a favorite for headache and eye-strain relief after long screen days. The removable cover slips off in seconds for easy washing, making it a durable, hygienic choice for home practice or busy studios.</p></section><section id='reviews'><h2>Customer Reviews &ndash; 4.7 <span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> (3)</h2><article class='review'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><h3>Perfect for my community studio</h3><p>These small cotton eye pillows are perfect for my community studio. The 8&quot; width is generous enough to cover the eyes comfortably. I bought the unscented for those who may have sensitivities to oils.</p><p class='rmeta'><span class='verified'>&#10003; Verified Buyer</span> &bull; Yoga Instructor, New Jersey &bull; 1/27/2018</p></article><article class='review'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><h3>Helps ease eye tension</h3><p>Great basic eye pillow. This one is great if you want something to travel with. Nice weight to the pillow &ndash; eases eye tension and shuts out the light.</p><p class='rmeta'>Philadelphia, PA &bull; 1/17/2017</p></article><article class='review'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span><h3>So natural feeling and so easy to care for</h3><p>My students, even the ones with the most sensitive allergies, love them. The weight is perfect. Covers are easy to remove and launder &ndash; they don&rsquo;t shrink. This was my second order.</p><p class='rmeta'>Yoga Instructor, Willis, TX &bull; 1/12/2015</p></article></section><section class='faq' id='faq'><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><details><summary>How do I clean the eye pillow?</summary><p>The 100% cotton cover is removable and machine washable. Customers recommend lightly spraying the flax insert with a mild white vinegar and water solution and letting it air-dry in the sun.</p></details><details><summary>Is it suitable for people with allergies?</summary><p>Yes &ndash; choose the unscented option. The pillow is 100% cotton with organic flax seed fill, and instructors report even highly sensitive students love them.</p></details><details><summary>What size is it?</summary><p>4&quot; x 8&quot; &ndash; wide enough to fully cover the eyes and block light, yet compact enough for travel.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer studio discounts?</summary><p>Yes. Order 10+ for $6.99 each or 50+ for $6.49 each &ndash; pricing applies automatically in your cart.</p></details></section><section><h2>Complete Your Practice With</h2><div class='cross'><div class='card'><a href='/yoga-bolsters'>Yoga Bolster</a><p class='cp'>from $24.99</p><a class='cta' style='font-size:14px;padding:10px' href='/yoga-bolsters'>Shop Now</a></d