;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 28px;color:#e9e2f7}.badge-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:30px}.badge{background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 18px;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600}.btn{display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;border-radius:8px;padding:15px 32px;font-size:1.05rem;transition:transform .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease}.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}.btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:#2b2200}.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--accent-dark)}.btn-secondary{background:transparent;color:#fff;border:2px solid #fff;margin-left:12px}.btn-inline{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;padding:12px 26px;font-size:1rem}.btn-inline:hover{background:var(--brand-dark)}.hero .micro{margin-top:14px;font-size:.85rem;color:#cfc3e8}.section{padding:56px 0}.section h2{font-size:1.9rem;text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px}.section p.lead{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);max-width:700px;margin:0 auto 40px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:24px}.card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(40,20,80,.07);border-top:4px solid var(--brand)}.card .icon{font-size:2rem;line-height:1;margin-bottom:14px;display:block}.card h3{font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--brand-dark)}.card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.98rem}.card p+p{margin-top:10px}.card .cta-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:14px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}.card .cta-link:hover{text-decoration:underline}.stats{background:#fff;border-top:1px solid #eee;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}.stats .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));text-align:center}.stat h3{font-size:2.2rem;color:var(--brand)}.stat p{color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}.band{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand) 0%,var(--brand-dark) 100%);color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:56px 20px}.band h2{font-size:1.9rem;margin-bottom:10px}.band p{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 26px;color:#e9e2f7;font-size:1.05rem}.guarantee{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--accent);border-radius:14px;padding:28px;max-width:860px;margin:0 auto}.guarantee .seal{flex:0 0 auto;width:92px;height:92px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:800;text-align:center;font-size:.75rem;color:#2b2200;padding:10px;line-height:1.25}.guarantee h3{color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:6px}.guarantee p{color:var(--muted)}.sticky-cta{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:var(--brand-dark);color:#fff;padding:12px 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;box-shadow:0 -3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.25);z-index:50}.sticky-cta span{font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem}.sticky-cta .btn{padding:10px 22px;font-size:.95rem}footer.pagefoot{text-align:center;padding:36px 20px 96px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}@media(max-width:640px){.hero h1{font-size:1.7rem}.btn-secondary{margin-left:0;margin-top:12px}.guarantee{flex-direction:column;text-align:center}}</style></head><body><header class=\\\"hero\\\"><div class=\\\"container\\\"><h1>The Direct Difference: Yoga Studio Specialists Since 1999</h1><p class=\\\"sub\\\">For more than 25 years, we've helped yoga studios of all sizes figure out exactly what they need to make their studio everything it can be. Need help setting up your studio? We're just a call away.</p><div class=\\\"badge-row\\\"><span class=\\\"badge\\\">✔ Trusted Since 1999</span><span class=\\\"badge\\\">✔ Wholesale Pricing for Everyone</span><span class=\\\"badge\\\">✔ Mats in 28 Colors</span><span class=\\\"badge\\\">✔ Satisfaction Guaranteed</span></div><a href=\\\"/\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">Shop Yoga Gear Now</a><a href=\\\"/contact-us/\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-secondary\\\">Talk to a Studio Specialist</a><p class=\\\"micro\\\">Fast shipping from our own warehouse &bull; Easy returns &bull; Quantity discounts on every order</p></div></header><section class=\\\"section stats\\\"><div class=\\\"container\\\"><div class=\\\"grid\\\"><div class=\\\"stat\\\"><h3>25+</h3><p>Years Serving Yogis &amp; Studios</p></div><div class=\\\"stat\\\"><h3>28</h3><p>Yoga Mat Colors In Stock</p></div><div class=\\\"stat\\\"><h3>100%</h3><p>Satisfaction Guarantee</p></div><div class=\\\"stat\\\"><h3>Decades</h3><p>of Loyal, Repeat Customers</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\\\"section\\\"><div class=\\\"container\\\"><h2>Why Shop Yoga Direct?</h2><p class=\\\"lead\\\">Selection, availability, quality, and prices that reward you for buying more — that's the Yoga Direct Difference.</p><div class=\\\"grid\\\"><div class=\\\"card\\\"><span class=\\\"icon\\\">🧘</span><h3>Yoga Studio Specialists</h3><p>Since 1999, we have helped yoga studios of all sizes figure out exactly what they need to make their studio everything it can be. Need help setting up your studio? Give us a call!</p><a class=\\\"cta-link\\\" href=\\\"/contact-us/\\\">Get free studio setup advice &rarr;</a></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><span class=\\\"icon\\\">🎨</span><h3>Selection, Availability &amp; Quality</h3><p>Sure, you can find yoga products at other places. But can you find mats in 28 colors? Can you get them shipped to you quickly? Is the product any good? While we do sell some other brands, many of our core products we manufacture ourselves — and we stand behind the quality.</p><p>Unlike many smaller competitors, we warehouse our products and offer a tremendous selection of colors and styles. Yoga Direct is your one-stop shop for yoga goods. And if you have a big order, we can handle it.</p><a class=\\\"cta-link\\\" href=\\\"/\\\">Browse our full selection &rarr;</a></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><span class=\\\"icon\\\">💰</span><h3>Low Prices &amp; Quantity Discounts</h3><p>We work very hard to provide our customers with quality products at great prices. Our supply connections, warehousing of goods for quick ship and availability, and dedicated customer service representatives differentiate us in the market.</p><p>As you will quickly see when browsing our products: <strong>the more you buy, the more you save!</strong> That's the Yoga Direct Difference. Wholesale pricing available to everyone — no account minimums, no hoops.</p><a class=\\\"cta-link\\\" href=\\\"/\\\">See quantity discounts &rarr;</a></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><span class=\\\"icon\\\">🛡️</span><h3>Satisfaction Guaranteed</h3><p>We are confident that you will love our products and services. If for any reason you are unhappy, give us a call and let's discuss. We have many customers who have been with us for <strong>DECADES</strong> — we want you to be one of them!</p><a class=\\\"cta-link\\\" href=\\\"/contact-us/\\\">Contact our team &rarr;</a></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><span class=\\\"icon\\\">↩️</span><h3>Easy Returns</h3><p>We understand that sometimes products are not exactly what you were expecting, or have an issue. We make every attempt to make returns easy. Give us a call or submit an RMA request through your account and we will send you what you need to return it.</p><a class=\\\"cta-link\\\" href=\\\"/login.php\\\">Start a return from your account &rarr;</a></div><div class=\\\"card\\\"><span class=\\\"icon\\\">🎁</span><h3>Rewards Program</h3><p>We love that we have such loyal customers. Sign up for our email list and register an account and be prepared to save! We frequently have extra special deals for those &ldquo;in the know&rdquo; and our most loyal customers. Join and see what it's all about.</p><a class=\\\"cta-link\\\" href=\\\"/login.php?action=create_account\\\">Create a free account &amp; start saving &rarr;</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\\\"section\\\"><div class=\\\"container\\\"><div class=\\\"guarantee\\\"><div class=\\\"seal\\\">100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED</div><div><h3>Shop Risk-Free</h3><p>If for any reason you're unhappy with your order, just reach out and we'll make it right. Easy returns, dedicated customer service reps, and quality we stand behind — that's why customers stay with us for decades.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\\\"band\\\"><h2>Outfitting a Studio? Placing a Big Order?</h2><p>Get wholesale pricing, quantity discounts, and expert guidance from a team that has equipped yoga studios since 1999. The more you buy, the more you save.</p><a href=\\\"/\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">Shop Wholesale Prices</a><a href=\\\"/contact-us/\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-secondary\\\">Request a Bulk Quote</a></section><footer class=\\\"pagefoot\\\"><p>Yoga Direct — Your one-stop shop for yoga goods since 1999. Selection. Quality. Low prices. Guaranteed.</p></footer><div class=\\\"sticky-cta\\\"><span>Wholesale pricing for everyone — the more you buy, the more you save!</span><a href=\\\"/\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">Shop Now</a></div></body></html>\", \"improvements\": [{\"What\": \"Added a conversion-focused hero section with a clear value-proposition headline, trust badges (Since 1999, 28 colors, wholesale pricing, guarantee) and two prominent CTAs: 'Shop Yoga Gear Now' and 'Talk to a Studio Specialist'.\", \"Why\": \"The original page was a plain wall of text with no calls to action, giving visitors no next step. A hero with primary/secondary CTAs channels ready-to-buy visitors into the catalog and high-value studio buyers into a sales conversation, directly lifting conversion.\", \"Hash\": \"a1f3c9e2\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a social-proof stats bar (25+ years, 28 mat colors, 100% satisfaction guarantee, decades of repeat customers).\", \"Why\": \"Quantified trust signals placed above the fold reduce purchase anxiety and increase credibility, which is proven to raise add-to-cart and checkout rates, especially for bulk/wholesale buyers evaluating a supplier.\", \"Hash\": \"b7d24f81\"}, {\"What\": \"Restructured the six original text sections into scannable benefit cards with icons, subheadings, bolded key phrases, and a contextual CTA link in every card (e.g., 'See quantity discounts', 'Create a free account & start saving', 'Start a return from your account').\", \"Why\": \"Users scan rather than read; card layout with per-benefit CTAs turns every value proposition into a conversion path (shop, sign up for rewards, request a quote) instead of dead-end copy, increasing click-through to revenue-generating pages.\", \"Hash\": \"c58e1d07\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a visual 100% Satisfaction Guarantee seal section and a bottom wholesale/bulk-order CTA band ('Shop Wholesale Prices' / 'Request a Bulk Quote').\", \"Why\": \"Risk-reversal (guarantee seal) is one of the highest-impact conversion levers, and a dedicated bulk-order CTA targets the page's most valuable segment — studio owners placing large orders — maximizing average order value and revenue.\", \"Hash\": \"d94ab6c3\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a persistent sticky bottom CTA bar reinforcing 'the more you buy, the more you save' with a Shop Now button.\", \"Why\": \"A sticky CTA keeps the conversion action visible at every scroll depth; visitors persuaded mid-page can act immediately without hunting for navigation, reducing drop-off.\", \"Hash\": \"e2c7508f\"}, {\"What\": \"Cleaned up copy errors and readability issues from the original ('other place' → 'other places', 'if you have big order' → 'if you have a big order', 'and will send you' → 'and we will send you'), while preserving all original messaging.\", \"Why\": \"Typos and grammatical errors erode trust and perceived professionalism — a critical factor when asking customers to place large wholesale orders; polished copy protects credibility and conversion.\", \"Hash\": \"f61b3a94\"}, {\"What\": \"Added SEO/meta improvements: descriptive title tag, meta description, mobile viewport tag, semantic HTML structure, and JSON-LD Organization/WebPage structured data.\", \"Why\": \"Better titles and structured data improve search visibility and click-through from Google, bringing more qualified traffic to the page, while mobile responsiveness ensures the growing share of mobile shoppers can convert easily.\", \"Hash\": \"98d0e5b2\"}]}","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'll start by retrieving that URL.The web_fetch tool converted the content to text rather than preserving the HTML structure. Since I can't access the raw HTML directly, I'll construct a properly formatted HTML page from the text content instead, which should work better for conversion purposes.\n\nI need to be careful not to invent details like phone numbers — I'll use generic contact links or placeholders instead of fabricating specific information. Building the improved page now with hero section, trust badges highlighting the company's history, value proposition sections with CTAs for shopping and rewards signup, and other conversion-focused elements.\n\nI'll fix the original copy's grammar issues and add a sticky CTA, linking to plausible BigCommerce paths like \"/\" for the shop and \"/contact-us\" for inquiries. For the newsletter signup, I'll point to a standard BigCommerce account creation flow. I'm avoiding fake testimonials and keeping things honest while still enhancing the page's structure and persuasiveness.\n\nWriting compact HTML with inline CSS...Now I have the text content from the fetch response, so I'm constructing an improved HTML page and then outputting it as a single-line JSON response.","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'll start by retrieving that URL.The web_fetch tool converted the content to text rather than preserving the HTML structure. Since I can't access the raw HTML directly, I'll construct a properly formatted HTML page from the text content instead, which should work better for conversion purposes.\n\nI need to be careful not to invent details like phone numbers — I'll use generic