\\"><h2>Returns Made Simple: 3 Easy Steps</h2><p class=\\\"sub\\\">Most returns are completed in under 5 minutes. Here's how it works:</p><div class=\\\"steps\\\"><div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">1</div><h3>Contact Us</h3><p>Call <strong>1-800-331-8233</strong> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:customerservice@yogadirect.com\\\">customerservice@yogadirect.com</a> with your order number within 30 days of delivery.</p></div><div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">2</div><h3>Get Your RMA</h3><p>We'll quickly issue a Return Merchandise Authorization (RMA) number and simple, step-by-step return instructions.</p></div><div class=\\\"step\\\"><div class=\\\"num\\\">3</div><h3>Ship &amp; Get Refunded</h3><p>Send the item back in its original condition. Your refund is processed within 3–5 business days of receipt — straight to your original payment method.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\\\"section alt\\\"><div class=\\\"container\\\"><div class=\\\"guarantee-box\\\"><div class=\\\"seal\\\">🏅</div><h3>Our 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee</h3><p>We stand behind every product we sell. If your yoga mat, prop, bolster, or accessory isn't right for you, return it within 30 days of delivery in new, unused condition for a full refund of the purchase price. Damaged or defective on arrival? We'll replace it or refund you — completely free.</p></div></div></section><section class=\\\"section\\\"><div class=\\\"container policy\\\"><h2>Return Policy Details</h2><h3>Eligibility</h3><ul><li>Items may be returned within <strong>30 days of delivery</strong>.</li><li>Items must be in <strong>new, unused condition</strong> with original packaging.</li><li>An RMA number is required for all returns — just contact us to get one instantly.</li></ul><h3>Refunds</h3><ul><li>Refunds are issued to your <strong>original payment method</strong> within 3–5 business days of us receiving your return.</li><li>Original shipping charges are non-refundable unless the return is due to our error.</li></ul><h3>Damaged or Defective Items</h3><ul><li>If your order arrives damaged or defective, contact us within 7 days and we'll make it right with a <strong>free replacement or full refund</strong> — including shipping.</li></ul><h3>Exchanges</h3><ul><li>Want a different color, size, or style? We're happy to help — contact our team and we'll arrange a quick exchange.</li></ul><h3>Non-Returnable Items</h3><ul><li>For hygiene reasons, opened personal-use items (such as neti pots) and clearance/final-sale items cannot be returned unless defective.</li></ul></div></section><section class=\\\"section alt\\\"><div class=\\\"container\\\"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p class=\\\"sub\\\">Quick answers to the most common return questions.</p><div class=\\\"faq\\\"><details open><summary>How long do I have to return an item?</summary><div class=\\\"a\\\">You have 30 days from the date of delivery to return most new, unused items for a full refund of the purchase price.</div></details><details><summary>How do I start a return?</summary><div class=\\\"a\\\">Simply call us at 1-800-331-8233 or email customerservice@yogadirect.com with your order number. We'll issue your RMA number and easy return instructions right away.</div></details><details><summary>When will I receive my refund?</summary><div class=\\\"a\\\">Refunds are processed within 3–5 business days after your return arrives and is inspected. Depending on your bank, it may take a few additional days to appear on your statement.</div></details><details><summary>What if my item arrives damaged or defective?</summary><div class=\\\"a\\\">Contact us right away — we'll send a free replacement or issue a full refund, including shipping costs. No need to jump through hoops.</div></details><details><summary>Can I exchange an item instead of returning it?</summary><div class=\\\"a\\\">Absolutely! Contact our customer care team and we'll arrange an exchange for a different size, color, or product.</div></details></div></div></section><section class=\\\"contact-strip\\\"><h2>Questions? Real Humans Are Here to Help.</h2><p>Our friendly, US-based customer care team is standing by Monday–Friday, 9am–5pm ET.</p><div class=\\\"options\\\"><span>📞 <a href=\\\"tel:18003318233\\\">1-800-331-8233</a></span><span>✉️ <a href=\\\"mailto:customerservice@yogadirect.com\\\">customerservice@yogadirect.com</a></span></div></section><section class=\\\"cta-final\\\"><h2>Ready to Shop with Zero Risk?</h2><p>With our 30-day money-back guarantee, the only thing you have to lose is stress. Namaste. 🧘</p><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"/Yoga-Mats_c_11.html\\\">Shop Best-Selling Yoga Mats</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a class=\\\"btn secondary\\\" href=\\\"/Sale_c_15.html\\\">Browse Sale Items</a></section><section class=\\\"newsletter\\\"><h3>Get 10% Off Your Next Order</h3><p>Join our newsletter for exclusive deals, new arrivals, and yoga tips delivered to your inbox.</p><form action=\\\"/newsletter-signup\\\" method=\\\"post\\\"><input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Enter your email address\\\" required aria-label=\\\"Email address\\\"><button type=\\\"submit\\\">Get My 10% Off</button></form></section></main><footer class=\\\"footer\\\"><div class=\\\"cols\\\"><div><h4>Shop</h4><a href=\\\"/Yoga-Mats_c_11.html\\\">Yoga Mats</a><a href=\\\"/Yoga-Props_c_12.html\\\">Yoga Props</a><a href=\\\"/Yoga-Bolsters_c_13.html\\\">Bolsters</a><a href=\\\"/Meditation_c_14.html\\\">Meditation</a><a href=\\\"/Sale_c_15.html\\\">Sale</a></div><div><h4>Customer Care</h4><a href=\\\"/Hassle-Free-Returns_ep_42-1.html\\\">Hassle-Free Returns</a><a href=\\\"/Shipping_ep_40-1.html\\\">Shipping Information</a><a href=\\\"/contact_us.asp\\\">Contact Us</a><a href=\\\"/FAQ_ep_41-1.html\\\">FAQ</a></div><div><h4>Company</h4><a href=\\\"/About-Us_ep_39-1.html\\\">About YogaDirect</a><a href=\\\"/Privacy-Policy_ep_43-1.html\\\">Privacy Policy</a><a href=\\\"/Terms_ep_44-1.html\\\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a></div><div><h4>Contact</h4><a href=\\\"tel:18003318233\\\">📞 1-800-331-8233</a><a href=\\\"mailto:customerservice@yogadirect.com\\\">✉️ Email Us</a></div></div><div class=\\\"legal\\\">© YogaDirect.com — The Lowest Prices on Yoga Supplies. All rights reserved.</div></footer></body></html>\", \"improvements\": [{\"What\": \"Rebuilt the page around a clear trust-focused hero with headline, reassurance copy, trust badges (30-day guarantee, easy returns, secure checkout, fast shipping), and a prominent 'Shop Risk-Free Now' CTA.\", \"Why\": \"Returns pages are visited by hesitant buyers validating purchase risk. Surfacing the guarantee immediately and pairing it with a shopping CTA converts reassurance-seekers directly into shoppers instead of dead-ending them on a policy page.\", \"Hash\": \"a1f2c3d4\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a visual 3-step 'Returns Made Simple' process (Contact → RMA → Refund) with expected refund timelines.\", \"Why\": \"Complexity and uncertainty around returns are top causes of cart abandonment. A scannable 3-step process with concrete timelines (3–5 business days) reduces perceived friction and pre-purchase anxiety, lifting conversion.\", \"Hash\": \"b2e4f6a8\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a prominent 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee box and a structured, scannable policy details section (eligibility, refunds, damaged items, exchanges, exclusions).\", \"Why\": \"Explicit, transparent guarantees increase buyer confidence and reduce customer-service load; structured bullets are far easier to scan than dense policy paragraphs, keeping users engaged.\", \"Hash\": \"c3d5e7f9\"}, {\"What\": \"Added an FAQ accordion with FAQPage JSON-LD structured data.\", \"Why\": \"Answers common objections on-page and makes the page eligible for rich FAQ snippets in search results, increasing organic traffic and click-through rates to the site.\", \"Hash\": \"d4c6b8a0\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a human-support contact strip with click-to-call phone and email links.\", \"Why\": \"Visible, easy access to real human support is a proven trust signal that lifts conversion, and tel:/mailto: links reduce friction for mobile visitors who dominate e-commerce traffic.\", \"Hash\": \"e5a7c9b1\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a bottom conversion section with dual CTAs to best-selling yoga mats and the sale category.\", \"Why\": \"Turns a passive policy page into a merchandising touchpoint, routing reassured visitors back into high-intent shopping paths (bestsellers and discounted items) to directly drive revenue.\", \"Hash\": \"f6b8d0c2\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a newsletter signup with a 10% off incentive.\", \"Why\": \"Email capture with a discount incentive monetizes visitors who aren't ready to buy today, building a remarketing channel that drives repeat revenue at very low cost.\", \"Hash\": \"0a9b8c7d\"}, {\"What\": \"Added a sitewide-style promo top bar (free shipping threshold + guarantee) and a full header/footer with category navigation.\", \"Why\": \"A free-shipping threshold nudges higher average order values, while persistent navigation prevents dead ends and keeps policy-page visitors moving toward product pages.\", \"Hash\": \"1b2c3d4e\"}, {\"What\": \"Added SEO meta title/description, canonical URL, Open Graph tags, mobile viewport, and a fully responsive layout.\", \"Why\": \"Better titles/descriptions improve search CTR, canonical and OG tags improve indexing and social sharing, and mobile responsiveness is essential since most shoppers browse on phones — all compounding into more traffic and conversions.\", \"Hash\": \"2c3d4e5f\"}, {\"What\": \"Note: the original page at yogadirect.com was not accessible at fetch time (server blocked the request), so this improved page was reconstructed as a complete, brand-consistent replacement rather than a diff of the live HTML.\", \"Why\": \"Transparency: placeholder policy specifics (timelines, thresholds, contact details, category URLs) should be verified against YogaDirect's actual policies and site structure before 